      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `59afcaf8a0c52a2754f75954ce5821611ee735f329d90d0e4b80c3dead0827af--prisoners-australia-2023.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Prisoners in Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2023\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 23 of 23\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | c3045a3f43605e36b3f3fcb2ecd2c27ce41e32a1456a5247994902af18d65344 | missing |\n| \"Table_14\" | 593c33a9701510d39955a26a59259b54a5de5285431b2887e470e48142586e6a | missing |\n| \"Table_15\" | fefcc812e5f833393629c64216c629f67c061e14a8516d21b2722b8233a7989a | missing |\n| \"Table_16\" | ad76336750eafb265fa7d2ee57fee4412db4068767f2a7c1634cece2e79ce596 | missing |\n| \"Table_17\" | f13e914177024cc2044f5bb14ada2688bc74f6a832ccb9f56fe1cf1d8e5b0055 | missing |\n| \"Table_18\" | b8b92dfe37a88417b135f8830c58814ae276d9bc9f9b5dd88b2a8229a2f42a5d | missing |\n| \"Table_19\" | 075a7e571b92f2db29147e521532584bb2efbff4b117561f31c7737581e2149f | missing |\n| \"Table_20\" | db84eba8d4208ebf5d7ab1dcd7f275d7dd08b85b5796e5cfe203ba62d55d5d43 | missing |\n| \"Table_21\" | 1f5a1a59a61d120e15b1e7baf6f33d3edd6620313d4001fe826c6786ba1f249e | missing |\n| \"Table_22\" | 0cc0e1496c2b1dca26c9003ed2daaefccb93b1f3ac8455cd49ca77214cefca48 | missing |\n| \"Table_23\" | b581bbeca92e7bd16c0c5a58c79b3c26afb5a0cd81d0febc14872c46b61e544d | missing |\n| \"Table_24\" | 0429b3f47714539c162c813bd0a5e06c7a6705b68de00b0fbc5a8e19d537c837 | missing |\n| \"Table_25\" | e662e0b41b96a5baac9c606751509a19f3805244f2b097a150c98e3bdf10cdb2 | missing |\n| \"Table_26\" | e01009d91473ebb371068779be95781a6400f610164990cbbeb65d7341b05b34 | missing |\n| \"Table_27\" | 389f8cbf765820b9129e6986a27915885ee1858aa586f41253e9c54046606ead | missing |\n| \"Table_28\" | 49428fa7ca8c9ab2859dab2d94235542729dd99ebc6c80b72f4998b1c87eed44 | missing |\n| \"Table_29\" | e1e61bc6e46a8eb0c7787338dcba13e55e251cdfe18abf9664cd5de58f3e9d47 | missing |\n| \"Tabl